        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Bear Lane, Christ Church, Oxford, Bear Inn, Oxford, Alfred Street, Blue Boar Street, Oxford, England\n- Organizations: University of Oxford\n- Concepts: Latin names\n\nFacts:\n- Christ Church is a constituent college of the University of Oxford in England.\n- Christ Church has the Latin name \"Ædes Christi\" and is sometimes known as \"The House.\"\n- Bear Lane is located just north of Christ Church in Oxford.\n- The circa-17th century incarnation of Bear Inn, Oxford, stands on the corner of Alfred Street and Blue Boar Street in central Oxford.\n- Bear Inn, Oxford, stands opposite Bear Lane and just north of Christ Church.",
